Hello! We're running a little contest here. 

Here are the rules: 

Record yourself speedrunning the first scenario of Full Void (you don't need to be on camera);
Post it on social media: Twitter, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube;
Mention OutOfTheBit;
Follow us and subscribe to our channel;
Entries accepted until 23:59 GMT of Sunday the 12th of March;
Among those who have posted their video with a better time than 4:18 we will randomly choose a winner who will get a Steam key for Super Arcade Football.

The time to beat is 4:18 recorded by Ali.

Good luck everyone!

